      <!-- RELIC BREAKPOINTS -->
      <div id="section-relic" class="tips-section tips-anchor">
        <h2>Relic Breakpoints</h2>
        <p>Do not judge these deities too early - they might not seem strong at the start but gain value through their relic level.</p>
        <h3>Key Breakpoints</h3>
        <div class="tips-callout">
          <p><strong>Hecate:</strong> starts feeling like a carry when her relic reaches Level 10. Below this she underperforms.</p>
          <p><strong>Poseidon:</strong> strong impact at Relic Level 10. Not worth a frontline slot before this.</p>
          <p><strong>Phoenix:</strong> higher relic levels unlock her infinite revive mechanic - the main reason to use her in Torment Rift.</p>
        </div>
        <h3>Relic Elixir Tiers</h3>
        <p>Start collecting the Genesis Elixir first to unlock relics and bring some to Level 10. Relics are not a priority in the beginning since you need your deity to be Exalted(+) or higher to unlock them.</p>
        <div class="tips-elixir-grid">
          <div class="tips-elixir-card">
            <div class="tips-elixir-range">Relic Level 1-10</div>
            <div class="tips-elixir-name">Genesis Elixir</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tips-elixir-card">
            <div class="tips-elixir-range">Relic Level 10-30</div>
            <div class="tips-elixir-name">Apotheosis Elixir</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tips-elixir-card">
            <div class="tips-elixir-range">Relic Level 30+</div>
            <div class="tips-elixir-name">Eternity Elixir</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Priority Order</h3>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>PvE core carries first:</strong> your main damage dealers (e.g. Isis to Relic 20).</li>
          <li><strong>Key timing relics second:</strong> heroes whose relic changes the opening seconds (e.g. Poseidon at Relic 10).</li>
          <li><strong>Premium endgame investments last:</strong> level 30+ is expensive - only when income supports it.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <!-- DEITY SWAP -->
      <div id="section-deity-swap" class="tips-section tips-anchor">
        <h2>Deity Swap Event</h2>
        <p>The Deity Swap Event lets you transfer all investment from one hero - stats, awakening, everything - onto a different hero. It is one of the biggest safety nets for early mistakes.</p>
        <div class="tips-warning-box">
          <h3>Do Not Rush It</h3>
          <p>Wait until you have enough game knowledge to know which hero you want to swap into. Swapping into another bad pick wastes the event entirely.</p>
        </div>
        <h3>Good Swap Targets</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Swap out:</strong> wrong early carry, duplicate role, old investment you no longer use.</li>
          <li><strong>Swap into:</strong> Hecate, Fengyi, Caishen, Yuelao, Demeter, or any other carry your account is built around now.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- WHEN YOU FEEL STUCK -->
      <div id="section-when-stuck" class="tips-section tips-anchor">
        <h2>When You Feel Stuck</h2>
        <p>Use this checklist when Odyssey progress stalls or you cannot beat the next stage.</p>
        <div class="tips-step-list">
          <div class="tips-step">
            <div class="tips-step-num">1</div>
            <div class="tips-step-body">
              <div class="tips-step-title">Check Your Shrine</div>
              <p>If Odyssey progress upgrades Shrine, go push Odyssey first. Some stages give you "Undying Flame" as reward to level up your shrine.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tips-step">
            <div class="tips-step-num">2</div>
            <div class="tips-step-body">
              <div class="tips-step-title">Check Beacon Tree</div>
              <p>Weekly Torment Rift progress gives account-wide stats that never get wasted.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tips-step">
            <div class="tips-step-num">3</div>
            <div class="tips-step-body">
              <div class="tips-step-title">Check Carry Relic</div>
              <p>Some heroes are weak before their breakpoint. Do not judge them too early.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tips-step">
            <div class="tips-step-num">4</div>
            <div class="tips-step-body">
              <div class="tips-step-title">Check Gear Placement</div>
              <p>Your top two damage dealers should have priority gear. Do not spread it around.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tips-step">
            <div class="tips-step-num">5</div>
            <div class="tips-step-body">
              <div class="tips-step-title">Check Resonating Altar</div>
              <p>You level five heroes to share their level with every hero on the Altar. If your Altar slots are empty you are missing account-wide level boosts.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tips-step">
            <div class="tips-step-num">6</div>
            <div class="tips-step-body">
              <div class="tips-step-title">Check Totems</div>
              <p>Totems must be pulled and upgraded with duplicates. Even one upgraded Totem is worth the early investment. Use an Attack or Damage totem first. Also try different hero positions in a fight.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

